  "question": {
    "text": "A body floats with $\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{n}}$ of its volume keeping outside of water. If the body has been taken to height h inside water and released, it will come to the surface after time t. Then",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Ca2nF",
      "text": "$t \\propto \\sqrt{\\mathrm{n}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "O736n",
      "text": "$t \\propto n$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "r7CPs",
      "text": "$t \\propto \\sqrt{\\mathrm{n}+1}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Lxkak",
      "text": "$t \\propto \\sqrt{\\mathrm{n}-1}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/-dVyu48dvVZLBKONlgYBQfGfvUja_sziUv4_YOegUS4.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>\n$F_B=m g ; V\\left(1-\\frac{1}{n}\\right) \\sigma g=V d g, \\Rightarrow d=\\left(\\frac{n-1}{n}\\right) \\sigma$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/ut27UK5t-zdquB2VfTYt7WtnkJzYcRE6v2YNWFDduFQ.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>\n\n$a=\\frac{F_b-m g}{m}=\\frac{v \\sigma g}{m}-g, \\quad a=\\frac{v \\sigma g}{v\\left(\\frac{n-1}{n}\\right) \\sigma}-g, \\quad \\Rightarrow a=\\frac{n g}{n-1}-g_n \\Rightarrow a=\\frac{g}{n-1}$\n\nNow for time, $h=\\frac{1}{2} a t^2, h=\\frac{1}{2} \\frac{g}{(n-1)} t^2, \\Rightarrow t=\\sqrt{\\frac{2 h}{g}(n-1)}=\\Rightarrow t \\alpha \\sqrt{n-1}$",
    "image": null
  },
